<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<Flow xmlns="http://soap.sforce.com/2006/04/metadata">
    <apiVersion>67.0</apiVersion>
    <decisions>
        <description>최초 관람 팬의 결제 완료 굿즈 구매 이력이 존재하는지 판단</description>
        <name>Check_If_Goods_Purchase_Exists</name>
        <label>Check If Goods Purchase Exists</label>
        <locationX>0</locationX>
        <locationY>0</locationY>
        <defaultConnectorLabel>Paid Goods Purchase Exists</defaultConnectorLabel>
        <rules>
            <name>No_Paid_Goods_Purchase</name>
            <conditionLogic>and</conditionLogic>
            <conditions>
                <leftValueReference>Get_Paid_Goods_Purchase.Id</leftValueReference>
                <operator>IsNull</operator>
                <rightValue>
                    <booleanValue>true</booleanValue>
                </rightValue>
            </conditions>
            <connector>
                <targetReference>Create_First_Merchandise_Campaign_Recommendation</targetReference>
            </connector>
            <label>No Paid Goods Purchase</label>
        </rules>
    </decisions>
    <description>팬의 최초 관람이 확인되면 결제 완료된 굿즈 구매 이력을 확인하고, 구매 이력이 없는 경우 First Merchandise Campaign 추천과 할인 혜택을 생성</description>
    <environments>Default</environments>
    <formulas>
        <description>Flow 실행일을 기준으로 3개월 뒤의 할인 혜택 만료일을 계산</description>
        <name>Benefit_Expiration_Date</name>
        <dataType>Date</dataType>
        <expression>ADDMONTHS({!$Flow.CurrentDate}, 3)</expression>
    </formulas>
    <interviewLabel>First Merchandise Campaign Flow - V1 {!$Flow.CurrentDateTime}</interviewLabel>
    <label>First Merchandise Campaign Flow -CA</label>
    <processMetadataValues>
        <name>BuilderType</name>
        <value>
            <stringValue>LightningFlowBuilder</stringValue>
        </value>
    </processMetadataValues>
    <processMetadataValues>
        <name>CanvasMode</name>
        <value>
            <stringValue>AUTO_LAYOUT_CANVAS</stringValue>
        </value>
    </processMetadataValues>
    <processMetadataValues>
        <name>OriginBuilderType</name>
        <value>
            <stringValue>LightningFlowBuilder</stringValue>
        </value>
    </processMetadataValues>
    <processType>AutoLaunchedFlow</processType>
    <recordCreates>
        <description>최초 관람 시점에 결제 완료된 굿즈 구매 이력이 없는 팬에게 First Merchandise Campaign 추천을 생성</description>
        <name>Create_First_Merchandise_Campaign_Recommendation</name>
        <label>Create First Merchandise Campaign Recommendation</label>
        <locationX>0</locationX>
        <locationY>0</locationY>
        <connector>
            <targetReference>Create_First_Merchandise_Discount_Benefit</targetReference>
        </connector>
        <inputAssignments>
            <field>Fan__c</field>
            <value>
                <elementReference>$Record.Fan__c</elementReference>
            </value>
        </inputAssignments>
        <inputAssignments>
            <field>Reason__c</field>
            <value>
                <stringValue>최초 관람 완료, 결제 완료된 굿즈 구매 이력 없음</stringValue>
            </value>
        </inputAssignments>
        <inputAssignments>
            <field>Recommended_Action__c</field>
            <value>
                <stringValue>First Merchandise Campaign</stringValue>
            </value>
        </inputAssignments>
        <inputAssignments>
            <field>Status__c</field>
            <value>
                <stringValue>Pending</stringValue>
            </value>
        </inputAssignments>
        <object>Recommendations__c</object>
        <storeOutputAutomatically>true</storeOutputAutomatically>
    </recordCreates>
    <recordCreates>
        <description>First Merchandise Campaign 추천이 생성된 팬에게 3개월간 유효한 굿즈 할인 혜택을 발급</description>
        <name>Create_First_Merchandise_Discount_Benefit</name>
        <label>Create First Merchandise Discount Benefit</label>
        <locationX>0</locationX>
        <locationY>0</locationY>
        <inputAssignments>
            <field>Benefit_Type__c</field>
            <value>
                <stringValue>Discount</stringValue>
            </value>
        </inputAssignments>
        <inputAssignments>
            <field>Expiration_Date__c</field>
            <value>
                <elementReference>Benefit_Expiration_Date</elementReference>
            </value>
        </inputAssignments>
        <inputAssignments>
            <field>Fan__c</field>
            <value>
                <elementReference>$Record.Fan__c</elementReference>
            </value>
        </inputAssignments>
        <inputAssignments>
            <field>Status__c</field>
            <value>
                <stringValue>Issued</stringValue>
            </value>
        </inputAssignments>
        <object>Benefits__c</object>
        <storeOutputAutomatically>true</storeOutputAutomatically>
    </recordCreates>
    <recordLookups>
        <description>최초 관람한 팬에게 기존 결제 완료 굿즈 구매 이력이 있는지 조회</description>
        <name>Get_Paid_Goods_Purchase</name>
        <label>Get Paid Goods Purchase</label>
        <locationX>0</locationX>
        <locationY>0</locationY>
        <assignNullValuesIfNoRecordsFound>false</assignNullValuesIfNoRecordsFound>
        <connector>
            <targetReference>Check_If_Goods_Purchase_Exists</targetReference>
        </connector>
        <filterLogic>and</filterLogic>
        <filters>
            <field>AccountId</field>
            <operator>EqualTo</operator>
            <value>
                <elementReference>$Record.Fan__c</elementReference>
            </value>
        </filters>
        <filters>
            <field>Order_Type__c</field>
            <operator>EqualTo</operator>
            <value>
                <stringValue>Goods Purchase</stringValue>
            </value>
        </filters>
        <filters>
            <field>Payment_Status__c</field>
            <operator>EqualTo</operator>
            <value>
                <stringValue>Paid</stringValue>
            </value>
        </filters>
        <getFirstRecordOnly>true</getFirstRecordOnly>
        <object>Order</object>
        <storeOutputAutomatically>true</storeOutputAutomatically>
    </recordLookups>
    <start>
        <locationX>0</locationX>
        <locationY>0</locationY>
        <connector>
            <targetReference>Get_Paid_Goods_Purchase</targetReference>
        </connector>
        <doesRequireRecordChangedToMeetCriteria>true</doesRequireRecordChangedToMeetCriteria>
        <filterLogic>and</filterLogic>
        <filters>
            <field>Total_Admissions__c</field>
            <operator>EqualTo</operator>
            <value>
                <numberValue>1.0</numberValue>
            </value>
        </filters>
        <filters>
            <field>Fan__c</field>
            <operator>IsNull</operator>
            <value>
                <booleanValue>false</booleanValue>
            </value>
        </filters>
        <object>Attendance_Record__c</object>
        <recordTriggerType>Update</recordTriggerType>
        <triggerType>RecordAfterSave</triggerType>
    </start>
    <status>Active</status>
</Flow>
